config SERVICE_SECURITY_LOCK
    bool "Security lock"
    depends on SERVICE_TOUCH
    default y
    help
      PIN lock and data shred triggered by phone lockdown or watch-side
      tamper signals. See docs/proposals/security-lockdown.md.

      Requires touch: the lock screen is an on-screen PIN pad, so this is
      only available on the newer watches (emery, gabbro).

if SERVICE_SECURITY_LOCK

module = SERVICE_SECURITY_LOCK
module-str = Security lock
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_level"

endif
